- Eat-a-my Rose. Okay.

00:40:22.920 --> 00:40:23.880
Oh, that's you.

00:40:23.960 --> 00:40:25.760
Yes, it's me on the shirt.
- Nice. Alright.

00:40:27.000 --> 00:40:31.840
I feel that I can be a very good YouTuber
for your brand.

00:40:31.920 --> 00:40:34.360
All right, well, tell me,
how would you sell one of our products?

00:40:34.440 --> 00:40:38.640
Okay. -Okay. -On 9/11,
when I saw the building collapsing...

00:40:38.720 --> 00:40:39.520
Yeah?

00:40:39.600 --> 00:40:40.720
Oh my God!

00:40:40.920 --> 00:40:43.160
I knew some guy that died there.

00:40:43.800 --> 00:40:45.000
Uncle Jimmy!

00:40:49.480 --> 00:40:50.760
I must relax.

00:40:52.480 --> 00:40:53.800
Yeah. I can't go back to my management

00:40:53.880 --> 00:40:55.720
